{"id":"starship","w":1400,"h":800,"zones":[{"id":"screenz","chip":"The viewscreen","box":[240,120,920,360]},{"id":"navz","chip":"Navigation","box":[140,440,400,280]},{"id":"engz","chip":"Engineering","box":[1000,360,390,380]}],"groups":{"space":"Out in space","nav":"Navigation","command":"Command","eng":"Engineering","people":"The crew"},"view":[0,100,1400,700],"roomsTitle":"The ship","title":"The Starship Bridge","kicker":"Picture Studio · Sci-Fi & Tech","dek":"The command deck of a spaceship: a viewscreen full of stars, the captain, the pilot, the engineer and a little robot.","inspired":"Inspired by space operas","frames":["Captain, there's a … on the screen!","Set a course for …","If we …, the ship will …","I think the planet might be …","The … is broken - we need to …","Engage the …!"],"truefalse":[{"s":"There is a planet with rings on the screen.","a":true,"level":"A1"},{"s":"The robot is next to the captain's chair.","a":false,"level":"A1"},{"s":"The captain's chair is red.","a":true,"level":"A1"},{"s":"There are three people on the bridge.","a":true,"level":"A1"},{"s":"The pilot is wearing a headset.","a":true,"level":"A2"},{"s":"The spacesuit is next to the engine panel.","a":false,"level":"A2"},{"s":"A comet is flying past the ship.","a":true,"level":"A2"},{"s":"The warning light is on the ceiling.","a":true,"level":"A2"},{"s":"The hologram shows a star map.","a":true,"level":"B1"},{"s":"The engineer is sitting down.","a":false,"level":"B1"},{"s":"The pilot's hand is on the control stick.","a":true,"level":"B1"},{"s":"The shield level is full.","a":false,"level":"B1"}],"prompts":{"A1":["Who is on the bridge? What are they doing?","What can you see on the big screen? Write five sentences.","Would you like to travel in space? Why?"],"A2":["Write the captain's log for one day on the ship.","Describe the planet on the screen. What do you think lives there?","Which job on the ship would you like: captain, pilot or engineer? Why?"],"B1":["The warning light starts flashing. What happens next? Use the past continuous.","Make a hypothesis: what might be on the planet? Use might, could, must.","Should we spend money on space travel or on problems on Earth? Discuss."],"B2":["You are the captain. Write a short speech to the crew before a dangerous mission.","Speculate about the planet: what could live there and how would you find out?","Is it right to send humans, not robots, into deep space? Argue your view."]},"rooms":[{"id":"bridge","word":"bridge","box":[0,110,1400,690],"label":[20,480],"level":"B1","ipa":"brɪdʒ","pos":"noun","ex":"The captain is on the bridge.","def":"The room on a ship where the captain controls it."}],"parts":[{"id":"screen","word":"viewscreen","pin":[700,180],"box":[260,158,880,300],"level":"B1","room":"space","ipa":"ˈvjuːskriːn","pos":"noun","ex":"A planet appeared on the viewscreen.","def":"A very big screen that shows what is outside."},{"id":"stars","word":"stars","pin":[360,360],"box":[300,180,800,260],"level":"A1","room":"space","ipa":"stɑːz","pos":"noun","ex":"Millions of stars shine outside.","def":"Small bright lights in the night sky - suns far away."},{"id":"planet","word":"planet","pin":[890,300],"box":[788,256,226,128],"level":"A1","room":"space","ipa":"ˈplænɪt","pos":"noun","ex":"The planet has golden rings.","def":"A big round world that goes round a star."},{"id":"rings","word":"rings","pin":[1000,322],"box":[788,306,226,50],"level":"A2","room":"space","ipa":"rɪŋz","pos":"noun","ex":"You can see its rings clearly.","def":"Circles of ice and rock round a planet."},{"id":"moon","word":"moon","pin":[1030,230],"box":[1012,212,36,36],"level":"A1","room":"space","ipa":"muːn","pos":"noun","ex":"The planet has a small grey moon.","def":"A round world that goes round a planet."},{"id":"galaxy","word":"galaxy","pin":[470,262],"box":[398,234,144,56],"level":"B1","room":"space","ipa":"ˈɡæləksi","pos":"noun","ex":"Our galaxy is called the Milky Way.","def":"A huge group of millions of stars."},{"id":"comet","word":"comet","pin":[640,214],"box":[556,186,94,52],"level":"B1","room":"space","ipa":"ˈkɒmɪt","pos":"noun","ex":"A comet flew past the ship.","def":"A ball of ice and dust with a bright tail."},{"id":"ship","word":"spaceship","pin":[730,395],"box":[694,380,70,30],"level":"A2","room":"space","ipa":"ˈspeɪsʃɪp","pos":"noun","ex":"Another spaceship is coming towards us.","us":"spacecraft","def":"A vehicle that travels in space."},{"id":"shields","word":"shield level","pin":[360,428],"box":[308,418,154,20],"level":"B2","room":"space","ipa":"ˈʃiːld ˌlevl","pos":"noun","ex":"The shield level is at eighty per cent.","def":"How strong the ship's protection is."},{"id":"console","word":"control panel","pin":[300,620],"box":[158,538,274,152],"level":"A2","room":"nav","ipa":"kənˈtrəʊl ˌpænl","pos":"noun","ex":"The pilot checks the control panel.","us":"console","def":"A surface with buttons and switches that controls a machine."},{"id":"buttons","word":"buttons","pin":[250,556],"box":[206,548,132,18],"level":"A1","room":"nav","ipa":"ˈbʌtnz","pos":"noun","ex":"Don't press the red buttons!","def":"Small things you press to make a machine work."},{"id":"stick","word":"control stick","pin":[398,520],"box":[388,506,24,46],"level":"B1","room":"nav","ipa":"kənˈtrəʊl stɪk","pos":"noun","ex":"She pushed the control stick forward.","us":"joystick","def":"A handle you move to steer."},{"id":"map","word":"star map","pin":[256,494],"box":[198,458,114,74],"level":"A2","room":"nav","ipa":"ˈstɑː mæp","pos":"noun","ex":"The route is on the star map.","def":"A map that shows where the stars and planets are."},{"id":"radar","word":"radar","pin":[355,502],"box":[318,472,74,60],"level":"B1","room":"nav","ipa":"ˈreɪdɑː","pos":"noun","ex":"Two ships are on the radar.","def":"A screen that shows things that are far away."},{"id":"pilot","word":"pilot","pin":[476,560],"box":[436,480,80,210],"level":"A2","room":"people","ipa":"ˈpaɪlət","pos":"noun","ex":"The pilot is steering the ship.","def":"